# Security standards

- Approved answers only; never invent facts
- Encrypt tenant secrets with ENCRYPTION_KEY; never return them from APIs
- Scrub PII before storage or model calls
- Verify WhatsApp signatures; block SSRF to private ranges
- Argon2id for passwords; HTTP-only cookies; CSRF for cookie auth
